#. module: zd_sale_accrual_cost_only
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/zd_sale_accrual_cost_only/models/account_accrued_orders_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"Sales accruals cannot use a manual amount. Select the sale order lines and "
"let the accrual be computed from the delivered and invoiced quantities."
msgstr ""
"销售应计不支持手动金额。请选择销售订单行，由系统按已发货和已开票数量自动"
"计算应计金额。"

#. module: zd_sale_accrual_cost_only
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/zd_sale_accrual_cost_only/models/account_accrued_orders_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"The selected sale order line mirrors an intercompany purchase return. Its "
"cost is accrued on the purchase side, so no sales accrual is needed."
msgstr ""
"所选销售订单行是公司间采购退货的镜像行，其成本已在采购侧计提，因此无需再生成"
"销售应计。"
